146
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:04,460
equal to an average of more than 100 million volts,

147
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:09,660
with temperatures of 50,000 degrees Fahrenheit.

148
00:08:09,661 --> 00:08:13,100
You have these huge voltage potentials sitting up in these clouds.

149
00:08:13,101 --> 00:08:16,360
It gets to a point where it will ionize a channel through the air,

150
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:21,100
