203
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:44,060
We did a 200,000 amp high current test.

204
00:11:44,340 --> 00:11:47,900
And as you can see, we did some significant damage to it.

205
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:52,260
Delivering blasts of over a million volts

